  rdfs:comment "Establishments, both public (government-sponsored enterprises) and private, primarily engaged in extending credit or lending funds raised by credit market borrowing, such as issuing commercial paper or other debt instruments or by borrowing from other financial intermediaries." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_2_1 .
