  rdfs:label "IDT 2.1.3.5 International Trade Financing" ;
  rdfs:comment "Establishments primarily engaged in providing working capital funds to U.S. exporters lending funds to foreign buyers of U.S. goods and/or lending funds to domestic buyers of imported goods. Includes administrative offices, operations centers, data and information systems, and telecommunication systems." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_2_1_3 .
