  rdfs:comment "Establishments primarily engaged in arranging loans by bringing borrowers and lenders together on a commission or fee basis. Includes administrative offices, operations centers, data and information systems, and telecommunication systems." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_2_1_4 .
