  rdfs:comment "Establishments primarily engaged in providing financial transaction processing (except central bank) reserve and liquidity services (except central bank) and/or check or other financial instrument clearinghouse services (except central bank). Includes administrative offices, operations centers, data and information systems, and telecommunication systems." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_2_1_4 .
