  rdfs:comment "Establishments primarily engaged in putting capital at risk in the process of underwriting securities issues or in making markets for securities and commodities and those acting as agents and/or brokers between buyers and sellers of securities and commodities, usually charging a commission. Includes administrative offices, operations centers, data and information systems, and telecommunication systems." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_2_2 .
