  rdfs:comment "Establishments primarily engaged in providing financial transaction processing, clearinghouse services, and quotations. Includes administrative offices, operations centers, data and information systems, and telecommunication systems. " ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_2_2_4 .
