  rdfs:comment "Facilities that provide backup capability for employees and data, information, telecommunications networks to allow securities, commodities, and financial investment institutions to continue functioning in the event of a disruption to their primary facilities." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_2_2_4 .
