  rdfs:comment "Clinics that are primarily engaged in providing healthcare related to public health issues (e.g., epidemic control, mass vaccination programs). Level of healthcare (e.g., physician, nurse) varies with availability of staff." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_10_2 .
