  rdfs:comment "Bus vehicles powered by diesel, gasoline, battery or alternative fuel engines contained within the vehicle. Can be single unit or articulated. Trolleybus vehicles propelled by a motor drawing current from overhead wires via a connecting pole called a trolley from a central power source not on board the vehicle." ;
