  rdfs:comment "An area including swamps, marshes, bogs, and similar areas such as wet meadows, river overflows, mudflats, and natural ponds that are characterized by periodic inundation or saturation and vegetation adapted for life in saturated soil conditions." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_16_3_4 .
