  rdfs:comment "Federal agencies dealing with nuclear and radioactive materials safety, security, and safeguards such as the Nuclear Regulatory Commission, Department of Energy, Department of Transportation, and Environmental Protection Agency." ;
  rdfs:subClassOf c:IDT_17_4 .
